# Snapshots for finding the hero's position in guest memory (tests/find_state.py):
# from a save at the castle, guest memory standing still twice, after walking
# right 1 s and 1 s more, back left 2 s, down 1 s and back up 1 s. Needs
# DOTHEROES_DEV_MEMSNAP=1 (port/native/dev_state.cpp) and a save (SAVES=);
# with DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 it also marks its start and end in the trace.
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START
sleep 3
press START
sleep 5
press CROSS
sleep 15
touch mark.trigger
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 4
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 4
hold RIGHT 1
sleep 1
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 4
hold RIGHT 1
sleep 1
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 4
hold LEFT 2
sleep 1
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 4
hold DOWN 1
sleep 1
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 4
hold UP 1
sleep 1
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 4
touch mark.trigger
sleep 5
